    "description": "The big-name isolate in a big tub. ISO100 blends hydrolyzed whey isolate with regular isolate for 25 g of protein in a scoop of about 32 g, around 110 to 120 calories, per its label at the time of writing. It uses sucralose, and some flavors add stevia, so it is no cleaner than LGXNDS on sweeteners. But it carries Informed Choice certification per retailer listings and comes in a wide range of flavors. The 5 lb Gourmet Vanilla tub was $148.18 for 76 servings when we checked, about $1.95 per 25 g.",
    "pros": [
      "Informed Choice certified, per retailer listings",
      "About $1.95 per 25 g in the 5 lb tub",
      "Huge flavor range, including the Pebbles flavors"
    ],
    "cons": [
