      "Best for": "Tested athletes, bulk buyers"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G6QHYZ6"
  },
  {
    "id": "nutricost-whey-protein-isolate",
    "name": "Nutricost Whey Protein Isolate, Milk Chocolate, 5 lb",
    "brand": "Nutricost",
    "badge": "Cheaper Alternative",
    "category": "Instantized whey protein isolate",
    "description": "The budget isolate. Per the retailer label at the time of writing, a 38 g scoop gives 30 g of protein, 140 calories, 1 g of fat and 1 g of sugar, with 60 servings per 5 lb bag. Ingredients are instantized whey isolate with soy lecithin, cocoa, natural and artificial flavors, salt, acesulfame potassium and sucralose. Nutricost says it is third-party tested, but we found no sport certification. At $102.95 when we checked, it costs about $1.43 per 25 g, roughly a third less than LGXNDS.",
    "pros": [
      "About $1.43 per 25 g at the price we saw",
