                The LGXNDS product page says zero artificial sweeteners, but every published flavor panel we checked lists sucralose. If you are avoiding it, read the ingredient list on the tub, not the marketing. A stevia-sweetened isolate such as Transparent Labs is the straightforward alternative for the same price.
