              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Charmies adds marshmallow bits with sugar, corn syrup, gelatin and four artificial colors, and Horchata lists instant non-fat dry milk alongside the isolate. Both are fine as treats. Neither matches the 100% isolate, no added sugar pitch, and Horchata is the wrong pick if lactose bothers you.
              </p>
