            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Treating third-party lab tested as certification</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A brand testing its own lots at a contract lab is not the same as an NSF Certified for Sport or Informed Sport listing that anyone can look up. We found no certification for LGXNDS. Drug-tested athletes should buy only products listed in a certification database.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
